WEBVTT

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:08.498
Declare test users once, in the project's agnt config.

00:00:19.047 --> 00:00:21.605
The app signs in through agnt's dev issuer.

00:00:21.605 --> 00:00:27.230
Over the tailnet, agnt asks Tailscale who you are, and offers only the personas you're allowed.

00:00:31.321 --> 00:00:33.302
Signed in as the standard user.

00:00:36.293 --> 00:00:39.488
To check the admin view, switch persona from the indicator.

00:00:39.488 --> 00:00:41.711
The app signs in again, as admin.

00:00:46.221 --> 00:00:48.947
Agents get the same switch through the devauth tool.

